#. セレスさんは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Celeste?"
msgstr ""

#. あら…
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "Oh, it is you."
msgstr ""

#. 聞きたいですか？
msgctxt "0003 | CELES"
msgid "You really want to know, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、その笑顔が…逆に怖い…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Th-That smile... It's strangely scary.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 世の中、知らない方がいい事って
#. 案外、多くありましてよ？
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid ""
"There are many, many things in this world you are\n"
"better off not knowing, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クンは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Mondo?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ああん！？
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "H-Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. た、大した…もんじゃねえ…！
msgctxt "0008 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Oh, it doesn't matter. It's not a big deal!"
msgstr ""

#. あんなの、黒幕ってのが勝手に作った
#. ニセモンに決まってらぁ！
msgctxt "0009 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"It was fake, anyway. It had to be! Whoever's doing all\n"
"this just pulled it out of his ass!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだよ！
#. わかったかよ、苗木！
msgctxt "0010 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's gotta be it! Those assholes can't fool\n"
"me!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガタガタガタ！」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 開かない…
#. 鍵が掛かってるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The door won't budge. It must be locked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>女子トイレに用事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is there anything I need to do in the girls bathroom?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ある訳ないよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...No, definitely not.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには、入れないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I can't get in there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんは、勝手に
#. 他人の部屋に入るような人じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka's not the type to go in someone's room without\n"
"permission.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他を探そう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should go look somewhere else.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんは、勝手に
#. 他人の部屋に入るような人じゃない。
